{"t":"Cormaya","s":"cormaya-ac7ea","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Cormaya_5919f2.jpg","q":27,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Cormaya</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"map\">\n<img alt=\"Cormaya\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"264\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cormaya_5919f2.jpg\" width=\"270\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"ruler\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Ruled by</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Daniel%20Steelsoul\">Daniel Steelsoul</a> (ordered by <a href=\"#/wiki/King%20Tibianus\">King Tibianus</a>)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">5</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"organization\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Organizations</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">None</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"near\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Nearby places</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Eremo%27s%20Island\">Eremo's Island</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Local</caption>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Hunting Places</th>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Quests</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><div class=\"geo-toc\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cormaya%20Dwarf%20Cave\">Cormaya Dwarf Cave</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dryad%20Gardens\">Dryad Gardens</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Edron%20Rotworm%20Cave\">Edron Rotworm Cave</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lair%20of%20the%20Treeling%20Witch\">Lair of the Treeling Witch</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Last%20Sanctum\">Last Sanctum</a></li><li>Lycanthrope Grounds</li></ul></div></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><div class=\"geo-toc\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/quest/a-piece-of-cake\">A Piece of Cake</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/druid-outfits-quest\">Druid Outfits Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/grimvale-quest\">Grimvale Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/the-cradle-of-monsters-quest\">The Cradle of Monsters Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/the-secret-library-quest\">The Secret Library Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/threatened-dreams-quest\">Threatened Dreams Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/what-a-foolish-quest\">What a Foolish Quest</a></li></ul></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">6.5<br/>December 19, 2001</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group pi-horizontal-group-no-labels\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Links</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Streets</td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Buildings</td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Towns</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Locations <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\n<b>Cormaya</b> is a small island south of <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33307,31999,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33307, 31999, 7)</a>). It can be accessed either from the <a href=\"#/wiki/Steamship\">steamship</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Farmine\">Farmine</a> or the ship in <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a>. It can also be accessed by traveling through the <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron%20Rotworm%20Cave\">Edron Rotworm Cave</a>. Because of access to experience in the two hunting locations, a large shoreline, and relatively few surface monsters, Cormaya is a place of relaxation and mana sitting. <a href=\"#/wiki/Pemaret\">Pemaret</a>, the local fisherman, can also take players to the sage <a href=\"#/wiki/Eremo\">Eremo</a> who sells a blessing, Amulets of Loss, and promotional spells. Cormaya is home to several individual houses and a series of flats, the prices of which have risen slightly since the new hunting location.\n</p><p>Raiding parties of <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Soldier\">Dwarf Soldiers</a> from Kazordoon and its new <a href=\"#/wiki/Cormaya%20Dwarf%20Cave\">mining site</a> occasionally appear and roam the eastern part of the island.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Cormaya_Garden\">Cormaya Garden</span></h2>\n<p>Cormaya Garden is a lovely place to be on the island of <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Cormaya</strong>. It can be found south of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Boat\">boat</a>, around the backside and just east of the Castle of the White Dragon Guildhall. Below the garden is a staircase to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Steamship\">steamship</a>. The garden is a place for rest and relaxation. It can be used as a place to take a break from hunting, as creatures can't get to it.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-NPCs\">NPCs</span></h2>\n<h3 style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><span id=\"w-Cormaya_NPCs_.288_NPCs.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Cormaya_NPCs_(8_NPCs)\">Cormaya NPCs (8 NPCs)</span></h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>Job\n</th>\n<th>Buy/Sell\n</th>\n<th>Location\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\"><a href=\"#/wiki/A%20Majestic%20Warwolf\">A Majestic Warwolf</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"npc-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/A%20Majestic%20Warwolf\"><img alt=\"A Majestic Warwolf\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/A_Majestic_Warwolf_944aa1.gif\" width=\"125\"/></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Artist\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Cormaya</strong>, in a cave on the east part of the island\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dedoras\">Dedoras</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"npc-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dedoras\"><img alt=\"Dedoras\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dedoras_b630ce.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Unknown.\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">Southeast of <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Cormaya</strong>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ghostly%20Wolf\">Ghostly Wolf</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"npc-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ghostly%20Wolf\"><img alt=\"Ghostly Wolf\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ghostly_Wolf_6fef03.gif\" width=\"83\"/></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Unknown Occupation\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Cormaya</strong>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Gurbasch\">Gurbasch</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"npc-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Gurbasch\"><img alt=\"Gurbasch\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gurbasch_78950b.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Ship Captain\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">8 levels underground, below <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Cormaya</strong>, at the end of the Cormaya Street across from Cormaya 11.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Hawkhurst\">Hawkhurst</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"npc-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Hawkhurst\"><img alt=\"Hawkhurst\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Hawkhurst_57a420.gif\" width=\"70\"/></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Ship Captain\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">Can be found in <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Cormaya</st